<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SUN CITY, South Africa 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final round scores</p>
<p>in the Million Dollar Challenge at the Gary Player Country Club</p>
<p>golf course on Sunday:</p>
<p>274 Ernie Els (South Africa) 67 70 71 66, Colin Montgomerie</p>
<p>(Britain) 65 71 70 68 (Montgomerie won at the third hole of</p>
<p>sudden-death play-off)</p>
<p>275 Steve Jones (U.S.) 67 71 67 70, Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 71 67</p>
<p>66 71</p>
<p>277 Steve Stricker (U.S.) 68 70 69 70, Ian Woosnam (Britain)</p>
<p>68 69 67 73</p>
<p>279 Bernhard Langer (Germany) 69 70 69 71</p>
<p>282 Mark O'Meara (U.S.) 69 71 70 72</p>
<p>283 Mark Brooks (U.S.) 68 70 72 73, Tom Lehman (U.S.) 71 71 68</p>
<p>73,</p>
<p>Nick Faldo (Britain) 73 68 69 73</p>
<p>284 Corey Pavin (U.S.) 68 71 76 69</p>
</text>
